window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Three steamy age-gap romances all in one place!</p> <p><i>More than a Spark</i></p> <p>Lauren, a disillusioned actress, and Brandon, a rule-following younger cop, clash like fire and gasoline. On the Fourth of July, a chance encounter leads to an unforgettable night. Lauren tries to brush it off as a mistake, but Brandon knows better.</p> <p>He pursues her, and their secret romance catches fire. As Lauren battles doubts and fears of their age gap, Brandon is ready to prove that what they have is real—and worth fighting for.</p> <p><i>More than a Treat</i></p> <p>Courtney’s Halloween party is legendary—until a noise complaint brings firefighter Kevin to her door. Mistaking him for a guest, she flirts shamelessly… until he sets her straight. Embarrassed but intrigued, she visits his fire station to apologize—and realizes their spark was no accident.</p> <p>Kevin wants more, but Courtney hesitates. With different lives and a noticeable age gap, she’s afraid to risk her heart. Kevin, however, plays to win—and he’s determined to show her love is worth the leap.</p> <p><i>More than a Dinner</i></p> <p>Kylie, a focused CEO, is blindsided when her aunt invites a surprise guest to Thanksgiving dinner: Brady, a charming young doctor. Their chemistry is instant, culminating in a steamy, stolen moment that leaves Kylie rattled.</p> <p>Trying to shake it off, she’s pulled back in when Brady invites her out the next day. What starts as an awkward Black Friday trip becomes a day full of laughter and connection. For the first time, Kylie imagines a life beyond work—with a man who sees through her walls.</p>"; 
